          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"guide-executive-section\" id=\"services-guide\">\n    <div class=\"executive-container\">\n        \n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"guide-header\">\n            <span class=\"header-tag\">UNSERE LEISTUNGEN</span>\n            <h1 class=\"header-title\">Was wir konkret tun</h1>\n            <p class=\"header-lead\">\n                Umfassende soziale Unterstützung für Familien aus der Ukraine in Nordbayern — kostenlos und nach Verfügbarkeit.\n            </p>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- General Disclaimer / Notice -->\n        <div class=\"disclaimer-banner\">\n            <div class=\"disclaimer-icon\">\n                <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"disclaimer-text\">\n                <strong>Wichtiger Hinweis:</strong> Die unten aufgeführten Leistungen werden auf freiwilliger Basis erbracht und hängen von unseren jeweiligen Kapazitäten ab. Wir bemühen uns stets, Ihnen direkt zu sagen, was realistisch ist. Wir glauben, dass eine ehrliche und schnelle Antwort besser ist, als unerfüllbare Erwartungen zu wecken.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 1: Housing & Jobcenter (The Big Pillars) -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path><polyline points=\"9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22\"></polyline></svg>\n                </span> \n                Wohnen &amp; Finanzielle Unterstützung\n            </h2>\n            \n            <!-- Housing Card -->\n            <div class=\"guide-card\">\n                <div class=\"card-header\">\n                    <h3>Wohnungslösungen finden</h3>\n                    <span class=\"status-tag info\">Kernleistung</span>\n                </div>\n                <p>Ein Teil der Wohnungen wird direkt im Rahmen unserer Initiative verwaltet. In anderen Fällen helfen wir bei der Suche nach einer passenden Wohnung bei Vermietern und Hausverwaltungen in der Region und koordinieren den Prozess — inklusive der Aufklärung des Vermieters über die Abläufe, die Einbindung des Jobcenters und was genau von ihm benötigt wird.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"card-details-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"detail-box\">\n                        <h4>Für wen ist das gedacht?</h4>\n                        <p>Familien und Einzelpersonen, die sich bereits in unserem Tätigkeitsgebiet befinden oder einen Umzug hierher planen.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"detail-box\">\n                        <h4>Was Sie in Ihrer Anfrage angeben sollten:</h4>\n                        <p>Anzahl der Personen und Alter der Kinder, Ihr aktueller Wohnort, der Zeitrahmen, in dem Sie eine Lösung benötigen, und Ihren Jobcenter-Status (falls vorhanden).</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"rule-box danger-rule\">\n                    <div class=\"rule-header\">\n                        <svg class=\"rule-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3z\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"13\"></line><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"></line></svg>\n                        <h3>Wichtig zu wissen</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <p>Es gibt keine Garantie oder Verpflichtung zur Wohnungsvermittlung. Die Verfügbarkeit variiert stark je nach Zeitraum und Stadt, und manchmal gibt es schlichtweg keine freien Wohnungen in der passenden Größe. Wir kommunizieren dies von Anfang an transparent.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Jobcenter Card -->\n            <div class=\"guide-card\">\n                <div class=\"card-header\">\n                    <h3>Unterstützung beim Jobcenter</h3>\n                    <span class=\"status-tag info\">Bürokratiehilfe</span>\n                </div>\n                <p>Allgemeine Orientierung während des gesamten Prozesses, Hilfe beim Verstehen von Bescheiden und Schreiben, Unterstützung bei der Vorbereitung auf Termine, Abstimmung mit dem Sachbearbeiter, Vermittlung von Sprachmittlern bei Bedarf und Begleitung im Genehmigungsverfahren für Wohnungen.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"detail-box detail-box-spacing\">\n                    <h4>Was das konkret beinhaltet:</h4>\n                    <p>Erklären, was genau von Ihnen gefordert wird, Identifizieren fehlender Unterlagen, Entschlüsseln behördlicher Schreiben und Erläutern, warum fristgerechte Rückmeldungen entscheidend sind.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"rule-box info-rule\">\n                    <div class=\"rule-header\">\n                        <svg class=\"rule-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg>\n                        <h3>Wichtig zu wissen</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <p>Entscheidungen liegen ausschließlich beim Jobcenter. Wir garantieren keine Bewilligungen, Leistungshöhen oder Bearbeitungszeiten und erbringen keine Rechtsberatung. Unsere Rolle ist es, sicherzustellen, dass Sie das Verfahren verstehen und gut vorbereitet sind.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 2: Registrations & Education (2 Columns) -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5\"></path></svg>\n                </span> \n                Anmeldung &amp; Bildung\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"two-column-grid\">\n                <!-- Anmeldung -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>Anmeldung (Wohnsitzanmeldung)</h3>\n                    <p>Die Anmeldung des Wohnsitzes bei der Gemeinde oder Stadt ist der fundamentale Schritt, von dem fast alles Weitere abhängt: Krankenversicherung, Bankkontoeröffnung, Sozialleistungen, Schulanmeldung und oft auch ein regulärer Mietvertrag.</p>\n                    <p>Wir erklären, welche Unterlagen üblicherweise benötigt werden, wie man einen Termin bucht und was zu tun ist, wenn Dokumente fehlen oder der nächste freie Termin weit in der Zukunft liegt.</p>\n                    <div class=\"notice-highlight\">\n                        <strong>Wichtig:</strong> Anforderungen und Bearbeitungszeiten variieren je nach Stadt und Behörde. Unsere Informationen basieren auf lokaler Erfahrung und müssen mit der zuständigen Stelle abgeglichen werden.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Schools -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>Schulanmeldung</h3>\n                    <p>Unterstützung bei der Suche nach einem passenden Bildungsangebot für das Alter und die Sprachkenntnisse Ihres Kindes, Hilfe beim Verstehen der erforderlichen Unterlagen, Übersetzungsarbeit und Koordination mit der Schule.</p>\n                    <p>In vielen Fällen ist auch ein Orientierungsgespräch mit dem Schulpersonal bezüglich Sprachförderklassen oder pädagogischer Unterstützung erforderlich.</p>\n                    <div class=\"notice-highlight\">\n                        <strong>Wichtig:</strong> Die Schulplatzzuweisung obliegt den Behörden und Schulen. Wir unterstützen und erklären den Ablauf, können aber die finale Entscheidung nicht beeinflussen.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Kindergarten -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>Kita-Anmeldung</h3>\n                    <p>Die Anzahl der Kindergartenplätze in der Region ist begrenzt, und in manchen Städten gibt es Wartezeiten von mehreren Monaten. Wir helfen beim Verstehen des Anmeldeverfahrens, der Registrierung und der Suche nach Alternativen.</p>\n                    <div class=\"rule-box mail-rule subcard-rule\">\n                        <strong>Wichtig:</strong> Wir können keinen freien Platz garantieren. Wenn aktuell keine Plätze verfügbar sind, kommunizieren wir dies direkt.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Translation -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>Übersetzung Ukrainisch–Deutsch</h3>\n                    <p>Vermittlung von Sprachmittlern für besonders wichtige Termine — Jobcenter, Behörden, Schule, Arzt — sowie für Dokumente, die präzise verstanden werden müssen.</p>\n                    <div class=\"notice-highlight\">\n                        <strong>Wichtig:</strong> Sprachmittler unterstützen ehrenamtlich, die Verfügbarkeit richtet sich nach ihren Kapazitäten. Je früher Sie uns kontaktieren, desto höher ist die Wahrscheinlichkeit einer rechtzeitigen Unterstützung.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 3: Living & Community (3 Columns) -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 9v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V9\"></path><path d=\"M9 22V12h6v10\"></path><path d=\"M2 10.6L12 2l10 8.6\"></path></svg>\n                </span> \n                Wohnen, Gemeinschaft &amp; Fortlaufende Begleitung\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"three-column-grid\">\n                <!-- Furniture -->\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 12V8H4v4\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4z\"></path><path d=\"M6 18v3\"></path><path d=\"M18 18v3\"></path></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Möbel &amp; Grundausstattung</h3>\n                    <p>In bestimmten Fällen können wir mit grundlegenden Möbeln, Haushaltsgegenständen und Erstausstattung unterstützen — Betten, Tisch, Stühle, Küchenutensilien. Dies hängt vollständig von verfügbaren Spenden ab, oft vermittelt durch andere Familien aus der Gemeinschaft.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mini-card-note\"><strong>Hinweis:</strong> Es handelt sich um funktionale Gebrauchtgegenstände, die Verfügbarkeit schwankt im Jahresverlauf stark.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Post-Move-In -->\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"15.5\" r=\"5.5\"></circle><path d=\"m21 2-9.6 9.6\"></path><path d=\"m15.5 7.5 3 3L22 7l-3-3\"></path></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Begleitung nach dem Einzug</h3>\n                    <p>Unsere Unterstützung endet nicht mit der Schlüsselübergabe. Wir begleiten Sie weiterhin bei der Anmeldung von Strom, Gas und Internet, Klärung der Krankenversicherung, dem Verstehen von Post an Ihre neue Adresse, Nachbarschaftsfragen und den üblichen Hausordnungen in Deutschland.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Community -->\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Anbindung an die Gemeinschaft</h3>\n                    <p>Wir fördern Treffen, lokale WhatsApp-Gruppen, Ausrüstungstausch und die Vernetzung zwischen eingelebten Familien und Neuan आलेल्या. Oft kommt die beste Antwort auf eine Frage direkt von einer Familie, die vor einigen Monaten am selben Ort vor der gleichen Situation stand.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Extreme Cases -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block extreme-block\">\n            <div class=\"guide-card extreme-card\">\n                <div class=\"extreme-header\">\n                    <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.93 4.93 4.24 4.24\"></path><path d=\"m14.83 9.17 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m14.83 14.83 4.24 4.24\"></path><path d=\"m9.17 14.83-4.24 4.24\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>\n                    <h3>Hilfe in akuten Notfällen</h3>\n                </div>\n                <p>In Ausnahmesituationen — wie akuter Mangel an Lebensmitteln, Kleidung oder anderen dringenden Bedürfnissen — erfolgt die Unterstützung nach unseren Kapazitäten und den spezifischen Umständen des Einzelfalls. Diese Anliegen werden individuell geprüft und streng vertraulich behandelt.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 4: Summary & CTA -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <div class=\"guide-card summary-cta-card\">\n                <h3 class=\"summary-title\">Zusammenfassung &amp; Wichtige Grundsätze</h3>\n                <p class=\"summary-text\">\n                    <strong>Bezüglich aller Leistungen:</strong> Die soziale Unterstützung wird vollständig kostenlos und ehrenamtlich erbracht. Eventuelle externe Gebühren für Behörden, Dienstleister oder Vermieter werden direkt an diese gezahlt und zu keinem Zeitpunkt über unsere Initiative abgewickelt.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"summary-tagline\">\n                    Sie sind sich nicht sicher, ob wir die richtige Anlaufstelle für Ihr Anliegen sind? Schreiben Sie uns dennoch — wir sagen Ihnen ehrlich, ob wir helfen können.\n                </p>\n                \n                <!-- BUTTONS (Mobirise Compatible) -->\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn cta-buttons-wrapper\" mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a class=\"btn custom-btn whatsapp-btn display-4 btn-warning\" href=\"request-assistance.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"></path></svg>\n                        WhatsApp Anna\n                    </a> \n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary custom-btn outline-btn display-4\" href=\"living-in-germany.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\"></path><path d=\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\"></path></svg>\n                        Ratgeber: Leben in Deutschland\n                    </a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "slider01-2c",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vqpqVIly1Q",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 56px",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0 22px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 22px"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "justify-content": "space-between"
            },
            ".logo-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "1.5rem",
              "img": {
                "width": "(@logoWidth * 1px)",
                "max-width": "100%",
                "height": "auto",
                "object-fit": "contain"
              }
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "32px",
              ".mbr-section-title": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              },
              ".mbr-text": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              }
            },
            ".lists-wrapper": {
              "display": "grid",
              "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr",
              "gap": "1rem",
              "margin-bottom": "32px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr"
              },
              ".list-wrap": {
                ".list": {
                  "padding": "0",
                  "margin": "0",
                  "list-style-type": "none",
                  ".item-wrap": {
                    "margin-bottom": "8px",
                    "cursor": "pointer",
                    "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out",
                    "&:first-child": {
                      "color": "@activeList"
                    },
                    "&:last-child": {
                      "margin-bottom": "0"
                    },
                    "&:hover, &:focus": {
                      "color": "@activeList"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".copy-wrapper": {
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "& when (@showBorder)": {
                "border-top": "1px solid @border",
                "padding-top": "16px"
              },
              "& when not (@showSocial)": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              "& when not (@showCopy)": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "display": "block"
              },
              ".social-wrapper": {
                "width": "50%",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin-bottom": "16px"
                },
                ".social-wrap": {
                  "display": "inline-flex",
                  "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                  ".soc-item": {
                    "margin-left": "32px",
                    "&:first-child": {
                      "margin-left": "0"
                    },
                    "a": {
                      "display": "block",
                      "&:hover, &:focus": {
                        ".mbr-iconfont": {
                          "color": "@active"
                        }
                      },
                      ".mbr-iconfont": {
                        "font-size": "16px",
                        "color": "@socColor",
                        "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              ".mbr-copy": {
                "width": "50%",
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%"
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ff5753"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".list": {
              "color": "#635d60"
            },
            ".mbr-copy": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "right"
            },
            ".list, .item-wrap": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            "a[href*=\"thebwas.com\"]": {
              "text-decoration": "underline",
              "text-underline-offset": "3px"
            },
            ".soc-item a": {
              "display": "inline-flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "min-width": "44px",
              "min-height": "44px"
            },
            ".item-wrap a": {
              "word-break": "normal !important",
              "overflow-wrap": "normal !important",
              "hyphens": "auto",
              "-webkit-hyphens": "auto"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".lists-wrapper": {
                "display": "grid !important",
                "grid-template-columns": "minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr)",
                "column-gap": "16px"
              },
              ".lists-wrapper .list-wrap": {
                "width": "auto !important",
                "max-width": "none !important",
                "margin": "0 !important"
              },
              ".lists-wrapper .item-wrap a": {
                "overflow-wrap": "break-word !important"
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "footer01",
          "_sourceTheme": "scalem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"footer01 scalem5\" group=\"Footer\" global once=\"footers\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Logo Width\" name=\"logoWidth\" min=\"50\" max=\"400\" step=\"10\" value=\"150\" condition=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Lists\" name=\"showLists\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Amount\" name=\"list\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"showLists\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"List Active Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"activeList\" condition=\"showLists\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Social\" name=\"showSocial\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Social Amount\" name=\"soc\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Social Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"socColor\" condition=\"showSocial\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Social Active Color\" value=\"#FF5753\" name=\"active\" condition=\"showSocial\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Border\" name=\"showBorder\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#635d60\" name=\"border\" condition=\"showBorder\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Copyright\" name=\"showCopy\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#0c2c68\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#292325\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            \n            <!-- עמודת טקסט וכותרת ראשית -->\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButtons || showLogo\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <!-- תוספת המקום ללוגו -->\n                    <div class=\"logo-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showLogo\">\n                        <a href=\"index.html\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-3uwvbn3uwvbn3uwv.png-171x171.png\" alt=\"ZusammenLeben\" width=\"171\" height=\"171\">\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>\n                        ZUSAMMENLEBEN\n                    </b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                        Unterstützung bei Integration, Wohnen und Gemeinschaft für Neuzugezogene und Einheimische in der Region.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"Contact.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-phone mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>\n                            Kontaktieren Sie uns\n                        </a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- עמודות הקישורים -->\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\" mbr-if=\"showLists\">\n                <div class=\"lists-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white\">Startseite</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"family-stories.html\" class=\"text-white\">Familiengeschichten</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"services.html\" class=\"text-white\">Leistungen</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"request-assistance.html\" class=\"text-white\">Hilfe anfordern</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"community.html\" class=\"text-white\">Gemeinschaft</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 1\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"living-in-germany.html\" class=\"text-white\">Leben in Deutschland</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"glossary.html\" class=\"text-white\">Glossar</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"learning-german.html\" class=\"text-white\">Deutsch lernen</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"refugee-rights.html\" class=\"text-white\">Flüchtlingsrechte</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"guides.html\" class=\"text-white\">Ratgeber</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"anna-shishoili.html\" class=\"text-white\">Anna Cheishvili</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 2\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"how-to-help.html\" class=\"text-white\">Wie Sie helfen können</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"social-activity.html\" class=\"text-white\">Soziale Aktivitäten</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"faq.html\" class=\"text-white\">Häufige Fragen (FAQ)</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"areasweserve.html\" class=\"text-white\">Einsatzgebiete</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 3\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"emergency.html\" class=\"text-white\">Notfall</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"Contact.html\" class=\"text-white\">Kontakt</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" class=\"text-white\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsApp-Support</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"areasweserve.html\" class=\"text-white\">Standort</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"impressum.html\" class=\"text-white\">Impressum</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"privacy.html\" class=\"text-white\">Datenschutz</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"usingtheweb.html\" class=\"text-white\">Nutzungsbedingungen</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 4\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Datenschutzerklärung</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Nutzungsbedingungen</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Impressum</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white\">Offizielle Website</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- אזור זכויות יוצרים ורשתות חברתיות -->\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-if=\"showSocial || showCopy\">\n                <div class=\"copy-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                    <div class=\"social-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <div class=\"social-wrap\">\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                <a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"WhatsApp\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-whatsapp\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 1\">\n                                <a href=\"mailto:zusammenleben.de@gmail.com\" aria-label=\"E-Mail\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-letter mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 2\">\n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 3\">\n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-copy mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-copy, .social-wrapper\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCopy\">\n                        © Urheberrecht 2026 Zusammenleben - Alle Rechte vorbehalten · Website von <a href=\"https://thebwas.com/\" class=\"text-white\">Amit Shechter</a>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "footer01-2b",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vqpoIpWKp1",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": true,
          "_once": "footers",
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "community.html": {
      "settings": {
        "title": "Unsere Gemeinschaft in Oberfranken | ZusammenLeben",
        "order": "10",
        "header_custom": "<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/community.html\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/de/community.html\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"uk\" href=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/ua/community.html\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/community.html\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/de/community.html\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"ZusammenLeben\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Unsere Gemeinschaft in Oberfranken | ZusammenLeben\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Familien, Ehrenamtliche und Partner vor Ort, die Ukrainern in Nordbayern einen Neuanfang ermöglichen. So machen Sie mit und bleiben verbunden.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/de/community.html\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"de_DE\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-3uwvbn3uwvbn3uwv.png-171x171.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets/zl/zl.css\" />\n<script src=\"assets/zl/zl.js\" defer></script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"url\":\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/de/community.html\",\"name\":\"Unsere Gemeinschaft in Oberfranken\",\"description\":\"Familien, Ehrenamtliche und Partner vor Ort, die Ukrainern in Nordbayern einen Neuanfang ermöglichen. So machen Sie mit und bleiben verbunden.\",\"inLanguage\":\"de\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/#site\"},\"about\":{\"@id\":\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/#org\"}},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Startseite\",\"item\":\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/de/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Unsere Gemeinschaft in Oberfranken\",\"item\":\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/de/community.html\"}]}]}</script>",
        "meta_descr": "Familien, Ehrenamtliche und Partner vor Ort, die Ukrainern in Nordbayern einen Neuanfang ermöglichen. So machen Sie mit und bleiben verbunden."
      },
      "components": [
        {
          "_name": "amenu1",
          "_sourceTheme": "solarm5",
          "_styles": {
            "& when (@sticky)": {
              "position": "sticky !important",
              "top": "0 !important",
              "z-index": "1030 !important",
              "width": "100%",
              "nav.navbar, .navbar-dropdown, .navbar-fixed-top": {
                "position": "relative !important"
              }
            },
            "& when not (@sticky)": {
              "position": "relative",
              "z-index": "1030",
              ".navbar-dropdown": {
                "position": "relative !important"
              },
              "& when (@transparent)": {
                ".navbar-dropdown": {
                  "position": "absolute !important"
                }
              }
            },
            "body": {
              "position": "relative"
            },
            ".navbar": {
              "min-height": "80px",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "border-bottom": "1px solid transparent",
              "& when not (@transparent)": {
                "box-shadow": "0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)",
                "background": "@menuBgColor"
              },
              "& when (@transparent)": {
                "background": "rgba(red(@menuBgColor), green(@menuBgColor), blue(@menuBgColor), @opacity)"
              },
              "&.opened": {
                "transition": "all 0.3s"
              },
              ".navbar-logo img": {
                "width": "auto"
              },
              "&.navbar-short": {
                "min-height": "60px",
                ".navbar-logo img": {
                  "height": "2.5rem !important"
                },
                ".navbar-brand": {
                  "min-height": "60px",
                  "padding": "0"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container, .container-fluid": {
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-wrap": "wrap",
              "margin": "auto",
              "align-items": "center"
            },
            ".brand-container": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "padding-bottom": "4px",
              "padding-top": "4px",
              "width": "100%"
            },
            ".navbar-brand": {
              "min-height": "60px",
              "flex-shrink": "0",
              "align-items": "center",
              "margin-right": "0",
              "padding": "5px 0",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "word-break": "break-word",
              "z-index": "1",
              "display": "flex",
              ".navbar-caption": {
                "line-height": "inherit !important"
              },
              ".navbar-logo a": {
                "outline": "none"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
              ".brand-container": {
                "width": "auto",
                "flex-grow": "1",
                "justify-content": "flex-start"
              },
              ".navbar-brand": {
                "padding-right": "20px"
              },
              ".navbar-collapse": {
                "justify-content": "flex-end",
                "padding-top": "10px",
                "padding-bottom": "10px",
                "display": "flex !important",
                "flex-basis": "auto",
                ".navbar-nav": {
                  "margin": "0 -0.5em",
                  "flex-grow": "1",
                  "justify-content": "flex-end"
                },
                ".mbr-section-btn": {
                  "margin-left": "auto"
                },
                "min-width": "0"
              },
              ".desktop-only-flex": {
                "display": "flex !important",
                "justify-content": "flex-end",
                "align-items": "center",
                "gap": "3px",
                "flex-wrap": "nowrap",
                "margin-left": "auto",
                "padding-right": "20px"
              },
              ".mobile-only": {
                "display": "none !important"
              },
              ".navbar-nav": {
                "flex-wrap": "wrap !important",
                "row-gap": "2px"
              },
              ".navbar-buttons .btn": {
                "padding": ".6rem 1.2rem !important",
                "font-size": "15px !important",
                "min-height": "44px"
              },
              ".navbar-nav .nav-link": {
                "padding-left": ".45em !important",
                "padding-right": ".45em !important"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".navbar": {
                "min-height": "60px !important"
              },
              ".desktop-only-flex": {
                "display": "none !important"
              },
              ".mobile-only": {
                "display": "flex !important",
                "align-items": "center",
                "gap": "0 !important",
                "background": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)",
                "padding": "0 4px !important",
                "border-radius": "20px",
                "border": "1px solid #eaeaea",
                "margin-left": "auto",
                "margin-right": "8px"
              },
              ".navbar-brand": {
                "flex-shrink": "initial",
                "flex-basis": "auto",
                "word-break": "break-word",
                "padding-right": "0.5rem",
                "min-height": "50px"
              },
              ".navbar-logo img": {
                "height": "2.3rem !important"
              },
              ".navbar-collapse": {
                "padding-top": "2px !important",
                "padding-bottom": "5px !important",
                "border-top": "1px solid #dddddd",
                "background": "@menuBgColor"
              },
              ".navbar-nav .nav-item": {
                "margin": "0 !important"
              },
              ".navbar-nav .nav-link": {
                "padding": "0.2rem 0.4rem !important",
                "font-size": "0.82rem !important",
                "margin": "0 !important",
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              ".dropdown-menu .dropdown-item": {
                "padding": "0.25rem 0.8rem !important",
                "font-size": "0.78rem !important",
                "margin": "0 !important",
                "text-align": "center"
              },
              ".mbr-section-btn": {
                "display": "flex",
                "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                "justify-content": "center",
                "padding": "2px 0",
                ".btn": {
                  "padding": "0.35rem 0.8rem !important",
                  "font-size": "0.82rem !important",
                  "flex-grow": "1",
                  "margin": "4px 15px"
                }
              },
              "nav.opened .dropdown-menu": {
                "top": "0"
              },
              ".mobile-only .lang-link": {
                "min-width": "30px",
                "min-height": "40px",
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              ".navbar-caption": {
                "word-break": "normal !important",
                "overflow-wrap": "normal !important"
              },
              "button.navbar-toggler": {
                "width": "44px !important",
                "height": "44px !important",
                "padding": "13px 9px !important"
              },
              "button.navbar-toggler .hamburger": {
                "position": "relative",
                "width": "26px",
                "height": "18px"
              }
            },
            ".dropdown-menu, .navbar.opened": {
              "background": "@menuBgColor !important"
            },
            ".dropdown-menu": {
              "padding": "0",
              "border-radius": "4px",
              "box-shadow": "0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)"
            },
            ".dropdown-item": {
              "border-bottom": "1px solid #e6e6e6",
              "padding": "0.5rem 1.8rem",
              "transition": "all 0.25s ease-in-out",
              "&:hover, &:focus": {
                "background": "@primaryColor !important",
                "color": "white !important"
              },
              "&:hover span": {
                "color": "white"
              },
              "&:first-child": {
                "border-top-left-radius": "4px",
                "border-top-right-radius": "4px"
              },
              "&:last-child": {
                "border-bottom": "none",
                "border-bottom-left-radius": "4px",
                "border-bottom-right-radius": "4px"
              }
            },
            ".dropdown-item.active, .dropdown-item:active": {
              "background-color": "transparent"
            },
            "a.nav-link": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "position": "relative",
              "transition": "all 0.2s",
              "&:hover": {
                "color": "@primaryColor !important"
              }
            },
            "ul.navbar-nav": {
              "flex-wrap": "wrap"
            },
            ".nav-item:focus, .nav-link:focus": {
              "outline": "none"
            },
            ".navbar-buttons": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "min-width": "0",
              "flex-shrink": "0"
            },
            ".card-wrap": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "padding": "2px 4px",
              "min-width": "auto"
            },
            ".contacts-menu .mbr-iconfont": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".contacts-menu .menu-divider": {
              "color": "#ccc",
              "font-weight": "300",
              "margin": "0 1px"
            },
            ".desktop-only-flex .mbr-iconfont": {
              "color": "@iconsContactColor"
            },
            ".flags-menu": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "gap": "5px",
              "background": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)",
              "padding": "3px 8px",
              "border-radius": "20px",
              "border": "1px solid #eaeaea"
            },
            ".lang-link": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "gap": "3px",
              "text-decoration": "none !important",
              "transition": "transform 0.2s ease",
              "&:hover": {
                "transform": "scale(1.08)"
              },
              "white-space": "nowrap",
              "flex-shrink": "0"
            },
            ".lang-code": {
              "font-size": "12px",
              "font-weight": "700",
              "color": "#333",
              "letter-spacing": "0.5px",
              "white-space": "nowrap"
            },
            ".flag-divider": {
              "color": "#ccc",
              "font-size": "12px"
            },
            "button.navbar-toggler": {
              "outline": "none",
              "width": "28px",
              "height": "18px",
              "cursor": "pointer",
              "transition": "all 0.2s",
              "position": "relative",
              "align-self": "center",
              "flex-basis": "auto",
              ".hamburger span": {
                "position": "absolute",
                "right": "0",
                "width": "26px",
                "height": "2px",
                "border-right": "5px",
                "background-color": "@hamburgerColor",
                "&:nth-child(1)": {
                  "top": "0",
                  "transition": "all 0.2s"
                },
                "&:nth-child(2)": {
                  "top": "6px",
                  "transition": "all 0.15s"
                },
                "&:nth-child(3)": {
                  "top": "6px",
                  "transition": "all 0.15s"
                },
                "&:nth-child(4)": {
                  "top": "12px",
                  "transition": "all 0.2s"
                }
              }
            },
            "nav.opened .hamburger span": {
              "&:nth-child(1)": {
                "top": "6px",
                "width": "0",
                "opacity": "0",
                "right": "50%",
                "transition": "all 0.2s"
              },
              "&:nth-child(2)": {
                "transform": "rotate(45deg)",
                "transition": "all 0.25s"
              },
              "&:nth-child(3)": {
                "transform": "rotate(-45deg)",
                "transition": "all 0.25s"
              },
              "&:nth-child(4)": {
                "top": "6px",
                "width": "0",
                "opacity": "0",
                "right": "50%",
                "transition": "all 0.2s"
              }
            },
            ".navbar-nav .nav-link": {
              "white-space": "nowrap"
            },
            ".navbar-buttons .btn": {
              "white-space": "nowrap"
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1399px)": {
              ".navbar-nav .nav-link, .navbar-nav .dropdown-item": {
                "font-size": "14px !important"
              },
              ".navbar-nav .nav-link": {
                "padding-left": ".3em !important",
                "padding-right": ".3em !important"
              },
              ".navbar-buttons .btn": {
                "padding": ".55rem 1rem !important",
                "font-size": "14px !important"
              },
              ".navbar-nav": {
                "margin": "0 !important"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199px)": {
              ".navbar-buttons .btn": {
                "padding": ".5rem .8rem !important",
                "font-size": "13.5px !important"
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"menu menu1\" group=\"Menu\" plugins=\"DropDown, TouchSwipe\" global once=\"menu\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Größe</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Volle Breite\" checked>\n        <header>Anzeigen/Ausblenden</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Logo-Größe\" inline name=\"logoSize\" min=\"3\" max=\"8\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Markenname\" name=\"showBrand\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Kontakt-Telefon\" name=\"showPhone\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Kontakt-Adresse\" name=\"showAddress\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Farbe der Kontaktsymbole\" name=\"iconsContactColor\" value=\"#0c2c68\" condition=\"showPhone || showAddress\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Menüpunkte\" name=\"showItems\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Symbole\" name=\"showIcons\">\n        <select title=\"Anzahl\" name=\"iconsAmount\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Symbolfarbe\" name=\"iconsColor\" value=\"#222222\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Schaltfläche\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Stile</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Fixiert\" name=\"sticky\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Eingeklappt\" name=\"collapsed\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparent\">\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Deckkraft\" name=\"opacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"transparent\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Farbe\" name=\"menuBgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hamburger-Menü\" name=\"hamburgerColor\" value=\"#222222\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <nav class=\"navbar navbar-dropdown\" mbr-class=\"{'navbar-fixed-top':sticky,\n                 'navbar-expand-lg':!collapsed,\n                 'collapsed':collapsed}\">\n        <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n            <div class=\"brand-container\">\n                <div class=\"navbar-brand\">\n                <span mbr-if=\"showLogo\" class=\"navbar-logo\">\n                    <a href=\"index.html\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-3uwvbn3uwvbn3uwv.png-171x171.png\" alt=\"ZusammenLeben\" mbr-style=\"{'height': logoSize + 'rem'}\">\n                    </a>\n                </span>\n                    <span mbr-if=\"showBrand\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"navbar-caption-wrap\"><a class=\"navbar-caption text-black\" data-app-selector=\".navbar-caption\" href=\"index.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Zusammen Leben</a></span>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- פרטי קשר + דגלים (מוצגים אך ורק במחשב) -->\n                <div class=\"contacts-menu desktop-only-flex\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap\">\n                        <span class=\"mobi-mbri-phone mobi-mbri\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"></span>\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0 display-4\"><a href=\"tel:+380 63 700 4615\" class=\"text-primary\">+380 63 700 4615</a></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <span class=\"menu-divider\">|</span>\n\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap\">\n                        <span class=\"mdi-maps-place\" style=\"font-size: 22px;\"></span>\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0 display-4\">Konradsreuth Alte Hofer Str. 1</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <span class=\"menu-divider\">|</span>\n\n<div class=\"flags-menu\">\n    <a href=\"index.html\" title=\"Deutsch\" class=\"lang-link\">\n        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/de.png\" srcset=\"https://flagcdn.com/48x36/de.png 2x\" alt=\"Deutschland\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n        <span class=\"lang-code\">DE</span>\n    </a>\n    <span class=\"flag-divider\">|</span>\n    <a href=\"../index.html\" title=\"Englisch\" class=\"lang-link\">\n        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/us.png\" srcset=\"https://flagcdn.com/48x36/us.png 2x\" alt=\"Vereinigte Staaten\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n        <span class=\"lang-code\">EN</span>\n    </a>\n    <span class=\"flag-divider\">|</span>\n    <a href=\"../ua/index.html\" title=\"Ukrainisch\" class=\"lang-link\">\n        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/ua.png\" srcset=\"https://flagcdn.com/48x36/ua.png 2x\" alt=\"Ukraine\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n        <span class=\"lang-code\">UA</span>\n    </a>\n</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- דגלים בלבד שיופיעו אך ורק בטלפון ליד ההמבורגר -->\n<div class=\"flags-menu mobile-only\">\n    <a href=\"index.html\" title=\"Deutsch\" class=\"lang-link\">\n        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/de.png\" alt=\"DE\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n    </a>\n    <span class=\"flag-divider\">|</span>\n    <a href=\"../index.html\" title=\"Englisch\" class=\"lang-link\">\n        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/us.png\" alt=\"EN\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n    </a>\n    <span class=\"flag-divider\">|</span>\n    <a href=\"../ua/index.html\" title=\"Ukrainisch\" class=\"lang-link\">\n        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/ua.png\" alt=\"UA\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n                <button class=\"navbar-toggler\" type=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#navbarSupportedContent\" data-bs-target=\"#navbarSupportedContent\" aria-controls=\"navbarNavAltMarkup\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Navigation umschalten\" mbr-if=\"showItems || showIcons || showButtons\">\n                    <div class=\"hamburger\">\n                        <span></span>\n                        <span></span>\n                        <span></span>\n                        <span></span>\n                    </div>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"navbarSupportedContent\" mbr-scroll-collapse>\n                <ul class=\"navbar-nav nav-dropdown\" data-app-modern-menu=\"true\" mbr-menu><li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"index.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Startseite</a>\n                    </li>\n    \n                    <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle display-4 text-primary\" href=\"#\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Über uns</a>\n                        <div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"social-activity.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Unsere Aktivitäten</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"anna-shishoili.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Anna Cheishvili</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"services.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Dienstleistungen</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"request-assistance.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Hilfe anfordern</a>\n                    </li>\n    \n                    <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle display-4 text-primary\" href=\"#\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Leben in Deutschland</a>\n                        <div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"glossary.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Glossar</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"learning-german.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Deutsch lernen</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"refugee-rights.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Rechte ukrainischer Flüchtlinge</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"guides.html\">Ratgeber & Artikel</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"areasweserve.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Unsere Regionen</a>\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle display-4 text-primary\" href=\"#\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Gemeinschaft</a>\n                        <div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"community.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Unsere Gemeinschaft</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"family-stories.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Familiengeschichten</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"faq.html#list01-b\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">FAQ</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"how-to-help.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Wie Sie helfen können</a>\n                    </li>\n    \n                    <!-- Emergency - Highlighted in a separate prominent color -->\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link font-weight-bold display-4 text-primary\" href=\"emergency.html\" style=\"color: #c81e1e !important;\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Notfall</a>\n                    </li></ul>\n                \n                <div mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"navbar-buttons mbr-section-btn\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary display-4\" href=\"Contact.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Kontaktieren Sie uns</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
